3:26.785" end="03:27.125">so </span><span begin="03:27.125" end="03:27.472">no </span><span begin="03:27.472" end="03:27.865"> ka</span><span begin="03:27.865" end="03:28.202">i </span><span begin="03:28.202" end="03:28.565">ka </span><span begin="03:28.565" end="03:29.045">n</span></text><text for="line-8bb380cf-ec2b-448f-8cc9-284d0fbeb519"><span begin="03:29.065" end="03:29.465">ne </span><span begin="03:29.465" end="03:29.665">ra </span><span begin="03:29.665" end="03:29.965">i </span><span begin="03:29.965" end="03:30.265">wa </span><span begin="03:30.265" end="03:30.629">ju </span><span begin="03:30.629" end="03:30.865">u </span><span begin="03:30.865" end="03:31.085">bu </span><span begin="03:31.085" end="03:31.805">n</span></text><text for="86635612-1ac4-424b-a915-d502eba37cbc"><span begin="03:32.085" end="03:32.285">i </span><span begin="03:32.285" end="03:32.458">ma </span><span begin="03:32.458" end="03:32.645">da </span><span begin="03:32.645" end="03:32.825">sha </span><span begin="03:32.825" end="03:33.045">te </span><span begin="03:33.045" end="03:33.205">i </span><span begin="03:33.205" end="03:33.585">ke </span><span begin="03:33.585" end="03:33.729">n </span><span begin="03:33.729" end="03:33.915">na </span><span begin="03:33.915" end="03:34.214">i </span><span begin="03:34.214" end="03:34.714">sa</span></text><text for="line-1e3e79cd-5d96-42d7-a7ca-4c1667f66634"><span begin="03:34.783" end="03:35.005">da </span><span begin="03:35.005" end="03:35.314">re </span><span begin="03:35.314" end="03:35.665">mo </span><span begin="03:35.665" end="03:36.065">ko </span><span begin="03:36.065" end="03:36.405">no </span><span begin="03:36.405" end="03:36.775">za </span><span begin="03:36.775" end="03:37.138">wo </span><span begin="03:37.138" end="03:37.485">yu </span><span begin="03:37.485" end="03:37.665">zu </span><span begin="03:37.665" end="03:38.665">re </span><span begin="03:38.665" end="03:38.945">na </span><span begin="03:38.945" end="03:40.520">i</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle"><text for="line-3f82f167-b507-4c77-a5d0-ee34d3045341">恋爱在旋转 如转轮一般</text><text for="line-5a8f84f5-88a5-48fa-a5a9-9aa598e9b73d">这朵花 绽放之夜的公主啊</text><text for="line-a9bb9d90-4e48-4e83-b779-e8cedb9beda8">为了不让坏虫子靠近</text><text for="line-f70df97a-34c5-49f8-ad8d-510315c9b0ae">闪烁着眼神瞄准猎物的</text><text for="line-1aefc86c-d0d0-4dea-b5e2-45733cdc866a">狩猎者</text><text for="line-ed2955d4-6172-4250-9bdd-5483db23c755">觉醒的信号悄然地</text><text for="line-3a800ab7-f312-45aa-968c-4355eb17de2e">毫无预兆地造访了</text><text for="line-0a9d0614-c612-4826-9748-116b417cd2c2">从想法天真的家伙开始</text><text for="line-ab2d6e31-17f1-402c-8cd0-79fe0a10e835">全都收割殆尽吧</text><text for="line-6b3dec7c-60c4-457b-80a1-c1a248bd1951">若是怀着这种程度的心意挑战</text><text for="line-2a7142c7-5532-41d9-97a4-98c5759b71cb">在燃烧着坠落之前</text><text for="47e3d0f4-103b-4f4a-a1c2-24b8dd93f813">从这里离开 彻底消失吧</text><text for="line-00a1d17d-5d8f-43f5-a84b-8269a962ecc4">若是觉悟已在胸中</text><text for="17cf26bb-9b37-4c1d-90c9-247efe8ef1ca">铭刻于心</text><text for="line-b4d4923f-b92c-4f94-a7f4-247ea71e4667">就将扔出的白手套拾起吧！</text><text for="line-9fa7bbe1-3a1e-4d6a-9157-95baf76b0b73">恋爱的旋转 如转轮一般</text><text for="53cc53f9-1ab0-4135-bbf6-700dd157943c">堕落而去</text><text for="line-4f96276a-b42b-4545-a108-fc761a65068c">就连红线也</text><text for="be6c21f8-28f3-430f-96c7-3f632b35e0c8">没有时间让你系上 绝・望</text><text for="line-6eef8036-9d1f-4e5c-ab32-daf1198827a7">瞄准已十分充分</text><text for="50091b08-493f-4659-8054-00ab83c2119b">胜败交给一时的运气</text><text for="line-03c62cdc-d59c-47da-94bf-7c9a02d7231f">谁也无法夺走这个宝座</text><text for="line-a4d38449-4999-4ebd-8ff5-e13643834522">若是能坦率地说出喜欢</text><text for="line-45664704-c1aa-4102-8131-16bdb3a1555e">任谁都羡慕的未来</text><text for="line-f6ba7998-ecee-466d-b8e6-30e23c623baf">你相信能去到吗？</text><text for="line-477d9bc1-431a-4417-bd31-17c3d614d26d">何等愚蠢</text><text for="line-78cedaa5-2783-407e-ad98-e39c0679dcaa">抢先一步 恋爱的博弈</text><text for="line-bc1889ad-f924-4755-b1ea-760931277c92">如疾风一般出其不意地超越</text><text for="line-eaaf2eb1-c6ec-4436-9ad4-bdb33a173a4b">将笑着的决斗者们</text><text for="line-49e18caa-72d0-490c-ab57-dade7a677973">狩猎殆尽吧</text><text for="line-f559d450-9969-4efd-b4aa-d8d975c40f8c">为了守护萌生的恋心</text><text for="line-9a366fe0-6f17-47e6-9e37-233439229dc6">情敌必须立刻</text><text for="6623f3e7-2c08-4713-814a-3a23221ba263">将其踹落 否则就会被打败</text><text for="line-5c97bd19-dac0-4171-9812-0fd36ee20ae7">贯彻的心意 绝无认输的打算</text><text for="line-47d244c2-11ba-40de-9445-ee2770a9e8a0">舍身发起挑战 在十分钟内沉没吧！</text><text for="line-806be218-93e7-41eb-bd7b-b7f55c91f241">已经无法回头</text><text for="4b717eb5-143e-4dbb-a24b-f23a4437ca73">若是察觉到这一点 即刻！断・罪</text><text for="line-6f831370-4b4a-4336-8e9d-a04e946d217f">罪与罚的恋爱</text><text for="5f15585f-5913-450c-a176-53f2927e5858">在何时能得到宽恕呢？</text><text for="line-7739b672-6db2-4236-ad71-69c3a281307e">谁也不知晓最终的结局</text><text for="line-1c5617af-2d55-4e65-872c-2ae3d7f71b57">恋爱的旋转 如转轮一般</text><text for="5cdc4326-9f17-4daa-9877-454fb4802acf">堕落而去</text><text for="fc7ea80b-0cd2-434c-8a5d-a3da828eccca">堕落而去</text><text for="line-17ce20e6-88d7-4b55-8b2e-5789689b9caa">彻底沉溺其中吧</text><text for="35327b4e-88e0-486e-8160-73345d173e7c">那罪孽深重的 快・感</text><text for="line-8bb380cf-ec2b-448f-8cc9-284d0fbeb519">瞄准已十分充分</text><text for="86635612-1ac4-424b-a915-d502eba37cbc">现在也在射程圈内</text><text for="line-1e3e79cd-5d96-42d7-a7ca-4c1667f66634">无论是谁都不会让出这个宝座</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:40.520"><div><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-5a8f84f5-88a5-48fa-a5a9-9aa598e9b73d" itunes:key="line-5a8f84f5-88a5-48fa-a5a9-9aa598e9b73d" begin="00:24.311" end="00:27.091" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:24.311" end="00:24.471">こ</span><span begin="00:24.471" end="00:24.631">の</span><span begin="00:24.631" end="00:25.127" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">花</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.631" end="00:24.831">は</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:24.831" end="00:25.127">な</span></span></span> <span begin="00:25.319" end="00:25.551" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">咲</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.319" end="00:25.551">さ</span></span></span><span begin="00:25.551" end="00:25.691">く</span><span begin="00:25.691" end="00:25.871" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:25.691" end="00:25.871">や</span></span></span><span begin="00:25.871" end="00:26.051">の</span><span begin="00:26.051" end="00:26.771" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">姫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.051" end="00:26.431">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:26.431" end="00:26.771">め</span></span></span><span begin="00:26.771" end="00:27.091">よ</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xml:id="line-a9bb9d90-4e48-4e83-b779-e8cedb9beda8" itunes:key="line-a9bb9d90-4e48-4e83-b779-e8cedb9beda8" begin="00:27.131" end="00:29.951" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="00:27.131" end="00:27.491" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">悪</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.131" end="00:27.331">わ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.331" end="00:27.491">る</span></span></span><span begin="00:27.491" end="00:27.671">い</span><span begin="00:27.671" end="00:28.388" tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">虫</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:27.671" end="00:28.000">む</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="00:28.111" end="00:28.388">し</span></span></span><span begin="00:28.388" end="00:28.545">が</span><span begin="00:28.545" end="00:28.731">つ</span><span begin="00:28.731" end="00:28.951">か</span><span begin="00:28.951" end="00:29.251">ぬ</span><span begin="00:29.251" end="00:29.651">よ</span><span begin="00:29.651" end="00:29.951">う</span></p><p xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-inter